# Data Analyst Project – Health Industry

This folder contains data analysis case studies related to the **Health industry**.

The purpose of this project is to practice analyzing patients data and understand how data is used to support decision-making in the hospitals.

---

## Objectives
- Develop analytical thinking in a Healthcare context
- Understand medical condition data analysis

---

## Scope of Work
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Data exploration and basic analysis
- Simple data visualization

---

## Tools Used
- Excel / Spreadsheet
- Power BI
- Python 
- SQL

---

This project is part of my learning journey in Data Analysis and will continue to be updated with new case studies.
